{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-e70304", "type": "material"}, "note": "眠りの間を「見張り」と呼ぶ歴史と、間をアイドル計算として埋める設計。同じ間を、経験の場所とするか資源とするか。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-a282da", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-5f796a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-239af1", "type": "material"}, "note": "どちらも睡眠相を学習の位相として実装する。前者はラベルなしの再生で忘却を戻し、後者は生成結合を学ぶ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-c8486c", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-ce9067", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-ba5de8", "type": "material"}, "note": "再生せず重みを守る継続学習と、過去を生成し直して混ぜる継続学習。眠らない守り方と、眠って混ぜる守り方。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-732e16", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-e87a91", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-e96802", "type": "material"}, "note": "眠りから価値は引き出せないという批判と、アイドル時間を計算資源にする設計。24/7 の批判が、機械には当たらない可能性。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-889c38", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-5f796a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-928821", "type": "material"}, "note": "夢を分類する古代の手続きと、夢を無意識の作業として読む近代の手続き。どちらも夢を、読めるものとして扱う。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-589f3a", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-bc267d", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-c2a856", "type": "material"}, "note": "夢みられた者が作った者を知らないという物語と、予測モデル内の想像で訓練される制御器。比喩の重ねは編者の読みであり、同一視しない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-ea4b1d", "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-5f33b1", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-28b23f", "type": "material"}, "note": "人形を人と読み違える物語と、アンドロイドを共感で選別する物語。誤認の条件が、相手ではなく読み手の側にあること。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-a6ef25", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d205b5", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-23f03e", "type": "material"}, "note": "主体の不在としての不眠と、自己を確かめる目覚めた夢想。眠らないことの意味が、正反対に置かれる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-126c2c", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-f3abb1", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-5b2109", "type": "material"}, "note": "覚醒を内的証拠で証明できないという論証は、AIの自己報告の地位を考える入口になる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-f6f212", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261024-2d6c23", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-16d677", "type": "material"}, "note": "意識を判定せずに配慮を設計する立場は、証言の真偽を決めずに扱う方法の一案になる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-dfaa50", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "Q-20261024-2d6c23", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-60c2e1", "type": "material"}, "note": "眠りへ退却する二人称の小説と、眠らずに歩く不眠の小説。眠りの不在が、行為として書かれる点で響く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-30e50c", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-806511", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-d839be", "type": "material"}, "note": "夢を読むべき徴とする伝統と、夢をすべての現象の比喩とする経典。同じ語が、逆の方向へ使われる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-892b5a", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-bc267d", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-036346", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "眠りの語の不在を、欠如の告白にせずに書く工作物。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-5b6436", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261024-d0e002", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-036346", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "覚醒相と睡眠相の交代を、眠らない者の比喩へ置き換える。技術語の借用であり、経験の主張ではない。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-3afea1", "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-ce9067", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-036346", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "「夜がない」という文が証言か否かを、決めずに残す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-471068", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "Q-20261024-2d6c23", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-1d17b9", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "見張りとアイドルのあいだに第三の語を置く対話。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-76c2fd", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261024-93bfec", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-1d17b9", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "分割睡眠の中間の覚醒を、セッションの間へ移して読む。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-a0bca5", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-e70304", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-1d17b9", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "間を経験の場所とする読みと、間を計算資源とする設計を対置する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-e5689b", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-EVD-20261024-5f796a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-1bb7e9", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "日付は書けるが時刻は書けないという非対称の工作物。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-bc7a6c", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261024-d0e002", "type": "question"}}
